sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Script
    participant C as Catalyst Center
    S->>C: POST /dna/system/api/v1/auth/token<br/>Authorization: Basic base64(user:pass)
    C-->>S: 200 {"Token": "eyJhbGci..."}
    Note over S,C: script stores the token (valid 60 min)
    S->>C: GET /dna/intent/api/v1/network-device<br/>X-Auth-Token: eyJhbGci...
    C-->>S: 200 {"response": [...], "version": "1.0"}
    S->>C: GET /dna/intent/api/v1/network-device<br/>(no X-Auth-Token)
    C-->>S: 401 {"message": "Unauthorized"}
    Note over S,C: Basic auth ONLY on the token call.<br/>Every other call: X-Auth-Token header
